# `let s = ##"a "# b"##` - the raw delimiter appearing inside its own body.
#
# The literal opens with two hashes, so only `"##` closes it and the `"#` at
# byte 13 is ordinary text. A hand that closes on the shortest delimiter it
# knows stops at byte 15 and reads ` b"##` as code. The extent [8, 20) is the
# whole claim; no assertion about node *presence* can state it, because both
# readings produce a raw_string_literal.
roots 1
mends 0
holds raw_string_literal
spans raw_string_literal 8 20
